You can easily create a professional resume using AI tools like ChatGPT, Canva, and Microsoft Word.

### How to create a resume using AI

* Open ChatGPT.

* Ask AI to create a fresher resume.

* Enter your education, skills, and personal details.

* Ask AI to arrange everything professionally.

* Copy the content into Canva or MS Word.

* Choose a simple resume template.

* Download your resume as a PDF.

### AI prompt to create a resume

You can copy this prompt into ChatGPT:

Act as a professional resume writer. Create a simple, attractive, one-page resume for a B.Tech Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning (AIML) fresher. Include career objective, education, technical skills, AI tools, projects, strengths, and languages. Use simple English and a professional format.

